// Output: [[1, 2], [3, 4], [5, 6]]
```

**Comparison:**

| Method | Purpose | Time Complexity |
|--------|---------|----------------|
| sort() | Sort array | O(n log n) |
| binarySearch() | Search sorted array | O(log n) |
| toString() | Format array as string | O(n) |

